    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 37870,
      "end_ms": 39280,
      "text": "因为它有这种关系吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 39280,
      "end_ms": 41020,
      "text": "他有这这种相似关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 41020,
      "end_ms": 42280,
      "text": "他有这种相似关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 42280,
      "end_ms": 46070,
      "text": "直到眼睛直接到眼睛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 46070,
      "end_ms": 48350,
      "text": "那么我我我我我要继续说的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 48350,
      "end_ms": 50150,
      "text": "他还有第四第四个关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 50150,
      "end_ms": 51230,
      "text": "他还有第四个关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 51230,
      "end_ms": 54380,
      "text": "就是整个脸都是在为了解除这张小脸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 54380,
      "end_ms": 55520,
      "text": "整个大脸的目的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 55520,
      "end_ms": 58140,
      "text": "都是在为了解除这个小脸的恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 61020,
      "text": "都是在为了卸除小脸的恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 61020,
      "end_ms": 62880,
      "text": "第四个我后面就讲快一点啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 62880,
      "end_ms": 66880,
      "text": "第四个就是通过人中的这两侧凸起物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 66880,
      "end_ms": 71580,
      "text": "人中的这个凸起的这两个边缘"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 71940,
      "end_ms": 74760,
      "text": "这两条凸起的这个边缘啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 74760,
      "end_ms": 76240,
      "text": "人中的凸起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 77320,
      "end_ms": 79560,
      "text": "这种人中凸起就是欺骗你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 79560,
      "end_ms": 82080,
      "text": "告诉你是鼻孔中是有东西流出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 82080,
      "end_ms": 86230,
      "text": "就是这个通路是继续这里继续这里延续的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 86230,
      "end_ms": 88400,
      "text": "就是它会骗你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 88400,
      "end_ms": 90980,
      "text": "就是说啊鼻孔中"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 90980,
      "end_ms": 95740,
      "text": "鼻孔中有一种一种生命力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 95740,
      "end_ms": 97220,
      "text": "生命的力量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 97460,
      "end_ms": 99680,
      "text": "生命力它是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 99680,
      "end_ms": 101510,
      "text": "继续在在皮下涌动了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 101510,
      "end_ms": 102640,
      "text": "继续"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 104300,
      "end_ms": 110620,
      "text": "啊继续在皮下涌动涌动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 110620,
      "end_ms": 114619,
      "text": "他涌动的效果就是让这个人中下面有两个凸起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 115040,
      "end_ms": 116390,
      "text": "你有两个凸起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 116390,
      "end_ms": 117660,
      "text": "有两个这个凸起"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 119380,
      "end_ms": 125580,
      "text": "所以这两个凸起它最终呢是汇聚到这个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 126040,
      "end_ms": 128199,
      "text": "他最终是汇聚到嘴巴里的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 128199,
      "end_ms": 130199,
      "text": "它最终是汇聚到嘴巴里的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 131559,
      "end_ms": 134639,
      "text": "这两个凸起最终是从这里是结合"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 134639,
      "end_ms": 137159,
      "text": "结合到这一个点是到嘴巴里去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 137159,
      "end_ms": 138569,
      "text": "到嘴嘴里面去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 138569,
      "end_ms": 141110,
      "text": "然后到嘴嘴里面去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 141110,
      "end_ms": 142970,
      "text": "这是第四重保险"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 142970,
      "end_ms": 147360,
      "text": "第五重保险一鼻翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 148420,
      "end_ms": 150390,
      "text": "第五重保险是鼻翼"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 150390,
      "end_ms": 154530,
      "text": "鼻子的这两翼和耳朵的形状"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 154530,
      "end_ms": 156140,
      "text": "鼻翼与耳朵"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 156999,
      "end_ms": 161909,
      "text": "耳朵的这种也是一种很类似的形状的形状"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 161909,
      "end_ms": 167560,
      "text": "所以有五重五重枷锁来解除这个这张小脸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 167560,
      "end_ms": 170210,
      "text": "恐怖的骷髅之非常恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 170210,
      "end_ms": 175100,
      "text": "诡异的骷髅脸的卸除他的这个那种那种紧张"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 175100,
      "end_ms": 176840,
      "text": "那种诡异的紧张啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 176840,
      "end_ms": 180120,
      "text": "所以它是一种自我遮蔽的诡异之物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 180120,
      "end_ms": 181980,
      "text": "自我遮蔽的诡异之物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 181980,
      "end_ms": 184080,
      "text": "他就利用外面这一整张脸"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 184080,
      "end_ms": 187120,
      "text": "还有它上面的不同的元素来来遮蔽它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 187560,
      "end_ms": 189720,
      "text": "所以它能产生美的效果"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 189720,
      "end_ms": 191970,
      "text": "it它产生了美"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 191970,
      "end_ms": 195339,
      "text": "产生美的效果啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 195339,
      "end_ms": 196239,
      "text": "它产生美的效果"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 196239,
      "end_ms": 198120,
      "text": "那么我还没有讲完"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 198120,
      "end_ms": 199320,
      "text": "我继续要说了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 199320,
      "end_ms": 201870,
      "text": "我继续要说嘴巴嘴唇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 201870,
      "end_ms": 205410,
      "text": "人的嘴唇为什么会会会会会觉得美"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 205410,
      "end_ms": 206240,
      "text": "why"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 208279,
      "end_ms": 212679,
      "text": "就是实际上人脸上眼睛两个洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 212679,
      "end_ms": 213279,
      "text": "鼻子两个洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 213279,
      "end_ms": 214449,
      "text": "嘴巴也是两"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 214449,
      "end_ms": 215769,
      "text": "嘴巴是两个洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 215769,
      "end_ms": 217200,
      "text": "嘴巴是两个洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 217999,
      "end_ms": 219609,
      "text": "他两个是不同的洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 219609,
      "end_ms": 220899,
      "text": "只不过它是一个嵌套关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 220899,
      "end_ms": 222320,
      "text": "它是洞中洞"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 225080,
      "end_ms": 227440,
      "text": "就是说你外面这个嘴唇张开了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 227440,
      "end_ms": 228340,
      "text": "你还有牙齿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 228340,
      "end_ms": 229660,
      "text": "对不对啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 229660,
      "end_ms": 230770,
      "text": "你还有牙齿"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 230770,
      "end_ms": 234360,
      "text": "所以它外面一层外面一层动"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 237360,
      "end_ms": 242000,
      "text": "和里面那层洞藏的东西是不一样的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 244100,
      "end_ms": 247240,
      "text": "人的嘴巴这个嘴唇啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 248000,
      "end_ms": 250660,
      "text": "先我先讲外面那一层这个唇吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 250660,
      "end_ms": 255920,
      "text": "我现在讲纯纯本身就代表一种血肉气息"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 256000,
      "end_ms": 258430,
      "text": "纯的这个颜色就是血肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 258430,
      "end_ms": 264459,
      "text": "所以它鼻孔的这两个这个这种死亡气息"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 264459,
      "end_ms": 267200,
      "text": "他立刻找到了他的对立面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 267200,
      "end_ms": 270380,
      "text": "就是所以我们这里这个还不止五个了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 270380,
      "end_ms": 272480,
      "text": "应该是还有第六个就是就是第四个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 272480,
      "end_ms": 273920,
      "text": "就是第四个到嘴唇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 273920,
      "end_ms": 275200,
      "text": "其实是到嘴唇"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 275219,
      "end_ms": 278579,
      "text": "第四个他这里解除他的这个死亡恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 278579,
      "end_ms": 280979,
      "text": "就是直接把血肉摆出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 280979,
      "end_ms": 283470,
      "text": "给你直接把血血肉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 283470,
      "end_ms": 285960,
      "text": "这种恐怖是直接把血肉给出的摆出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 285960,
      "end_ms": 288030,
      "text": "所以红唇烈焰好美丽啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 288030,
      "end_ms": 290540,
      "text": "因为它卸除了对于这个死亡的恐惧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 291400,
      "end_ms": 294250,
      "text": "所以纯本身是一种血肉之物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 294250,
      "end_ms": 297910,
      "text": "但是这种血肉之物它又是它必须是高度有序的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 297910,
      "end_ms": 299290,
      "text": "它必须上面的纹理"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 299290,
      "end_ms": 301750,
      "text": "这个纹理得是数值的高度有序的才能"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 301750,
      "end_ms": 304480,
      "text": "因为血肉很快也会导致恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 304539,
      "end_ms": 306159,
      "text": "血肉也会导致恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 306159,
      "end_ms": 306939,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 306939,
      "end_ms": 309099,
      "text": "为了解除这种血肉的恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 309099,
      "end_ms": 311260,
      "text": "它必须要有唇纹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 311460,
      "end_ms": 313920,
      "text": "有有竖直的平行的唇纹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 313920,
      "end_ms": 315180,
      "text": "平行的竖直的唇纹"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 315180,
      "end_ms": 318580,
      "text": "就是感觉到这个是个很有趣的很有趣的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 318960,
      "end_ms": 320460,
      "text": "很有趣的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 320620,
      "end_ms": 323380,
      "text": "很规则的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 323380,
      "end_ms": 325990,
      "text": "这个要卸除他那种混乱的恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 325990,
      "end_ms": 329640,
      "text": "因为血肉一般会让人感受到这种混乱的恐怖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 330579,
      "end_ms": 331619,
      "text": "他要卸除他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 331619,
      "end_ms": 332999,
      "text": "他要卸卸卸掉它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 332999,
      "end_ms": 336240,
      "text": "卸除不不仅不仅如此"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 336240,
      "end_ms": 338760,
      "text": "纯的这种可怕性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 338760,
      "end_ms": 341490,
      "text": "它不仅这样卸除了它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 341490,
      "end_ms": 344160,
      "text": "它有几种方式在解除纯的可怕性啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 344160,
      "end_ms": 345960,
      "text": "有几种方式解除纯的可怕性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 345960,
      "end_ms": 347520,
      "text": "它都形成美学"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 347599,
      "end_ms": 351859,
      "text": "美学这个样态的就是这个洞中洞啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 351859,
      "end_ms": 355080,
      "text": "这两个洞你就一张嘴巴"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 356759,
      "end_ms": 360139,
      "text": "里面的是还是一个牙齿啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 360139,
      "end_ms": 364470,
      "text": "这个你这个其实也是很恐怖的一个一个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
